<div class="d-panels font-secondary-light">
<div id="aip_a" class="d-panel p" style="display: none">
<div class="p" id="aff1">
<sup>a</sup>Knowledge Synthesis Group, Clinical Epidemiology Program, Ottawa Hospital Research Institute, Canada</div>
